@@ -0,0 +1,21 @@
+## Why
+
+The desk needs to see at a glance what can still be rented for a given period, instead of trying `book` item by item.
+
+## What Changes
+
+- Add `availability(query)` to the rental service, with `query` = `{ start, end, kind? }`.
+- It returns the sorted ids of the equipment of that kind (any kind when `kind` is omitted) that is free for the whole period.
+- Read-only: it reserves nothing.
+
+## Capabilities
+
+### New Capabilities
+
+### Modified Capabilities
+- `rental`: adds an availability requirement; period rules and overlap rules are reused unchanged.
+
+## Impact
+
+- `src/index.ts`: new `availability` method and query type on `RentalService`.
+- `test/rental.test.ts`: new tests.
